.architecture{goal="LIN semantic translator leveraging existing ecosystems" layers="LIN self-host compiler -> LLVM IR -> x86-64 Haswell native" interoperability="C Zig Rust Lua Crystal Nim OCaml libraries ABI toolchains"}
